nnual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/505160/5051600318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/505160/5051600317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/505160/5051600316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/505160/5051600315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/505160/5051600314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2013/TALBROS_AUTOMOTIVE_COMPONENTS_LTD-505160-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_1510_TALBROAUTO_2012_2013_05092013152445.zip","source":"the data provider"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/TALBROS_AUTOMOTIVE_COMPONENTS_LTD-505160-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Talbros Automotive Components Limited reported a record performance for Q1 FY27, with total income reaching INR242 crores, representing a 15% year-on-year growth, and an EBITDA margin of 17.6%. Management highlighted strong demand across domestic vehicle segments and expanding opportunities in data center generators and EV components, alongside some temporary margin pressures from elevated commodity and labor costs. The company maintains its FY27 revenue growth guidance of 18% to 20% with EBITDA margins around 17%. Furthermore, management outlined medium-term revenue targets for its gasket and forging divisions up to FY30. Talbros Automotive Components Limited reported Q1 FY27 financial highlights including a group turnover of ₹387 crores and consolidated total income from operations of ₹242 crores.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company targets group revenue growth of 18% to 20% for FY27.","quote":"For FY27, we continue to continue to have a target group revenue target of about 18% to 20%, with margins being in the range of about 17-odd percent, a little bit maybe 17.5% because we're still working out the whole impact of the inflationary pressures.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"The company targets taking exports to 35% by FY28.","quote":"We are targeting to take our exports to 35% by FY28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Gasket division revenue is seen reaching INR850 crores to INR900 crores in the next 3 to 4 years.","quote":"Regarding your 2 divisions, sorry to interruypotu your 2 divisions, gaskets and forging the next 3 years to 4 years, I easily see gasket going to about INR850 crores to INR900 crores and forging at about INR650 crores to INR700 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Sustainable EBITDA margin can be assumed around 17%.","quote":"Around 17%, you can assume.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects to deliver 15% to 20% year-on-year growth in FY27.","quote":"We remain confident of delivering a 15% to 20% year-on-year growth in '27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"},{"claim":"Management targets maintaining EBITDA margins between 17% to 18% through product mix, operational leverage, and cost management.","quote":"Our focus will be to maintain EBITDA margins between 17% to 18% through product mix and operational leverage as well as cost management.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects Marelli revenue to grow between 35% to 40% and Marugo to grow around 15% next year.","quote":"Yes. Next year, I'm expecting Marelli maybe should to grow between 35% to 40% and Marugo should be around 15%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The passenger vehicle industry recorded sales of approximately 1.27 million units, registering a growth of 26% year-on-year.","quote":"The passenger vehicle industry recorded sales of approximately 1.27 million units, registering a growth of 26% year-on-year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"The 2-wheeler segment grew by almost 20% year-on-year at 5.63 million units.","quote":"The 2-wheeler segment also continues recovery with a growth of almost 20% year-on-year at 5.63 million units.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Commercial vehicles recorded steady performance with an industry volume of nearly 2.83 lakh units, registering a 15% growth.","quote":"Commercial vehicles recorded steady performance during quarter with industry volume of nearly 2.83 lakh units, registering a healthy 15% growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"EV passenger vehicles volume grew by 87% year-on-year.","quote":"EV passenger vehicles volume grew by 87% year-on-year, while electric 2-wheeler continued to gain market share.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Electric 2-wheeler continued to gain market share with a growth of approximately 68%.","quote":"electric 2-wheeler continued to gain market share. with a growth of approximately 68%, supported by increasing charging infrastructure.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Global OEMs reducing China dependence are accelerating supply-chain realignments toward reliable alternate geographies.","quote":"Global OEMs reducing China dependence are accelerating supply-chain realignments toward reliable alternate geographies","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf"},{"claim":"Demand looks good in quarter 1 as stated by management.","quote":"The demand is still looking good in quarter 1 as I speak. and we are going to add capacities accordingly.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"},{"claim":"Inquiries remain strong despite West Asia war leading to temporary cost pressures.","quote":"While the West Asia war may lead to some temporary cost pressures, inquiries remain strong, and we believe Talbros is well placed to navigate these challenges.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Planned capex is about INR103 crores for the year across gaskets, forgings, and heat shields.","quote":"Our planned capex is about INR103 crores for the year across gaskets, forgings, heat shields and to try and meet the demands of the OEM.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Total capex is planned at INR 51 crores for FY26 and INR 103 crores for FY27.","quote":"Total cupex v FY26: INR 51 crs v Y27 INR 103 crs","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"EBITDA for Q1 FY27 stood at INR43 crores at a margin of 17.6%.","quote":"EBITDA at INR43 crores at a margin of 17.6%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Margins during the quarter witnessed temporary pressure on account of elevated commodity prices, particularly steel and aluminium as well as other inflation costs.","quote":"Margins during the quarter witnessed temporary pressure on account of elevated commodity prices, particularly steel and aluminium as well as other inflation costs such as labour increases in some states.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Gasket division EBITDA increased to INR29 crores with a growth of 32%.","quote":"And EBITDA increased to INR29 crores with a growth of 32%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Forging division EBITDA stood at INR14 crores in Q1 of FY27 as against INR13 crores of Q1 of FY26.","quote":"EBITDA stood at INR14 crores in QI of FY27 as against INR13 crores of Q1 of FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated EBITDA stood at ₹42.8 crores with an EBITDA margin of 17.6%.","quote":"EBITDA 42.8 34.9 23%\nEBITDA Margin 17.6% 16.5%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf"},{"claim":"Profit After Tax before exceptional items stood at ₹30.0 crores with a PAT margin of 12.4%.","quote":"Profit After Tax (Before Exceptional Items) 30.0 22.3 35%\nPAT Margin % 12.4% 10.5%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf"},{"claim":"Q4 FY26 EBITDA reached INR 45 crores with a record high margin of 18.7%.","quote":"At the EBITDA level, at Q4, we declared EBITDA of INR45 crores, a growth of 12.9% and a record high margin of 18.7%, reflecting robust operating leverage and disciplined cost ‘management.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"},{"claim":"Geopolitical tensions in the West Asia region led to an increase in raw material and freight costs.","quote":"Geopolitical tensions in the West Asia region led to an increase in raw material and freight costs.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The gasket and heat shield division reported revenue of INR164 crores growing by 21% year-on-year.","quote":"The division reported revenue of INR164 crores of the INR242 crores I mentioned to you, growing by 21% year-on-year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"The Forging division reported revenues of about INR78.4 crores.","quote":"Our Forging division continued its recovery this quarter with revenues being at about INR78.4 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Marelli Chassis Systems revenue for the quarter stood at INR105 crore, registering a growth of 43% on year-on-year basis.","quote":"rarely for the quarter stood at INR105 crore, registering a growth of 43% on Y-o0-Y basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Talbros Marugo revenue for the quarter stood at INR40 crores registering a growth of 31% on year-on-year basis.","quote":"Revenue for the quarter stood at INR40 crores registering a growth of 31% on Y-0-Y basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"TACL along with its joint ventures has received orders worth over ₹1,000 crores.","quote":"TACL along with its JV’s has received orders worth over Z 1,000 crores","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf"},{"claim":"New orders worth INR 500 crores have been secured in the Forging business.","quote":"New orders worth INR500 crores have been secured in the Forging business with a significant portion from new onboarded major European car maker in Europe as well.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"},{"claim":"New domestic orders worth INR 170 crores have been secured for hoses and anti-vibration products.","quote":"New domestic orders worth INR170 crores have been secured for hoses and anti-vibration products, showing good growth in the coming new years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Operational pressures from West Asia crisis, manpower shortages, higher wage costs, and elevated LPG prices have largely moderated though a few channels remain.","quote":"Operational pressures from West Asia crisis, manpower shortages, higher wage costs, elevated LPG prices have largely moderated through a few channels remain.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company targets taking exports to 35% by FY28.","quote":"We are targeting to take our exports to 35% by FY28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf","timeframe":"FY28"},{"claim":"Group revenue growth target is about 18% to 20% for FY27.","quote":"For FY27, we continue to continue to have a target group revenue target of about 18% to 20%, with margins being in the range of about 17-odd percent, a little bit maybe 17.5% because we're still working out the whole impact of the inflationary pressures.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The newly secured orders are to be executed over a period of 5 years.","quote":"These orders are to be executed over the period of next 5 years","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf","timeframe":"next 5 years"},{"claim":"Commercialization for the newly secured order products will start from FY27.","quote":"The commercialization for these products will start from FY27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company targets maintaining EBITDA margins between 17% to 18% in FY27.","quote":"Our focus will be to maintain EBITDA margins between 17% to 18% through product mix and operational leverage as well as cost management.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Management remains confident of delivering 15% to 20% year-on-year growth in FY27.","quote":"We remain confident of delivering a 15% to 20% year-on-year growth in '27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":39,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":8,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}